{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 52, :comments ["<b>And he called Ephraim.</b> After the ancestors Abraham and Isaac, concerning whom 'ashes' is said: Abraham, as it is said: ״ואנכי עפר ואפר״; Isaac, like ashes upon the altar. For 'Ephraim' connotes two ashes. And therefore Israel are called by the name Ephraim, as it is said: ״הבן יקיר לי אפרים״."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:06:57.191230636Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}